                                        "entry_id": "72fd0db5-b896-358e-b7cc-0a6d8faa0f76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Gattung von Sträuchern oder kleinen Bäumen der Kernobstgewächse (Pyrinae) innerhalb der Familie der Rosengewächse (Rosaceae)., Crataegus monogyna"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f4c3dc6-1dc4-4557-bcb4-487b7de9f190",
                                                "sense_id": "a5b7380c-f600-30cf-a968-05a8cf126d8c",
                                                "text": "Obwohl diese Pflanze Weißdorn heißt, trägt sie auch rote Früchte."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "d4e213d5-3d0b-42c9-91c8-2dd8cbb0785a",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd842522-a751-3fc5-a2f6-57669fced9dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "50c8e75a-7086-387b-9dcf-e9aa727b09b1",
                        "target_lang_word": "hawthorn",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hawthorn",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4d6372a1-09cd-3430-a12a-c041f069aa5c",
                                        "entry_id": "d6d11c1f-3942-3ffa-99a0-8a9aaa8690a5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any of various shrubs and small trees of the genus Crataegus having small, apple-like fruits and thorny branches"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e03a0de-7ff5-49d9-8b99-baf643c31c0e",
                                                "sense_id": "4d6372a1-09cd-3430-a12a-c041f069aa5c",
                                                "text": "Proust, an author to whom Humboldt had introduced me and in whose work he gave me heavy instruction, said he was often attracted to people whose faces had something in them of a hawthorn hedge in bloom."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2362fff6-0d71-47bc-8c49-acdb3bdeec8c",
                                                "sense_id": "4d6372a1-09cd-3430-a12a-c041f069aa5c",
                                                "text": "In fact, a railway lined with hedgerows and shrubs would be perfect for reliability and biodiversity. Hawthorn, for example, can take a good cut and grow back strongly, while still providing shelter for creatures and acting as a natural fence line. Even palisade fencing can be climbed by a determined trespasser, but a good-size hawthorn hedge, lined with thorns and the inevitable brambles, is a serious obstacle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a17672f6-5af4-4699-95c6-00d2151a424d",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd842522-a751-3fc5-a2f6-57669fced9dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "50c8e75a-7086-387b-9dcf-e9aa727b09b1",
                        "target_lang_word": "tornapple",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "df617611-10b8-4bda-b50c-acf7465adec6",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd842522-a751-3fc5-a2f6-57669fced9dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "50c8e75a-7086-387b-9dcf-e9aa727b09b1",
                        "target_lang_word": "aubépine",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "aubépine",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2b3a0c97-016f-3855-bc1c-f235d3d91510",
                                        "entry_id": "79dd7ae9-0e48-3f14-8c87-ba86a30953f6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Arbrisseau épineux de la famille des rosacées (Rosaceae), qui est utilisé en haies et qui produit de petites fleurs blanches, quelquefois roses ou rouges, d’une odeur très agréable, disposées par bouquets ou corymbes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "85bc43f0-3a27-47d2-a363-b421b0607546",
                                                "sense_id": "2b3a0c97-016f-3855-bc1c-f235d3d91510",
                                                "text": "On y retrouve encore de nos jours des aubépines, rejetons de ceux d’antan."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da0e7cdb-cff3-45c5-9606-7df3daaa1676",
                                                "sense_id": "2b3a0c97-016f-3855-bc1c-f235d3d91510",
                                                "text": "Au moment où je passe devant une cave de pierre à l’abandon entourée de cyprès et de buissons d’aubépine me reviennent en mémoire ces paroles de Doha, ma seule amie."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0f02c61-e415-4f53-8c06-ff2a26a1bd38",
                                                "sense_id": "2b3a0c97-016f-3855-bc1c-f235d3d91510",
                                                "text": "Au bas, le long du sentier, régnait un rustique palis, perdu dans une haie d’aubépine et de ronce."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba701352-56c3-4df2-b4b6-f13571b65736",
                                                "sense_id": "2b3a0c97-016f-3855-bc1c-f235d3d91510",
                                                "text": "Octave va nous ouvrir la petite porte qui donne sur le chemin des aubépines."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8a464a7e-8bde-40f5-9278-965567451eca",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd842522-a751-3fc5-a2f6-57669fced9dd",
                        "source_sense_id": "50c8e75a-7086-387b-9dcf-e9aa727b09b1",
                        "target_lang_word": "espino",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "espino",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f754ecbc-3895-3de1-8d1e-bd42344a0839",
                                        "entry_id": "2050cbb8-494a-36b5-81ea-812ede2a5fa0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Crataegus spp.) Nombre dado a unas doscientas especies de árboles y arbustos, de la familia de las Rosáceas y género Crataegus, que se encuentran en zonas frías de Europa, Norteamérica y Asia. Tienen ramas espinosas, flores blancas o rosadas, y decorativos frutos con forma de bayas rojas que aparecen en otoño y permanecen en el árbol durante el invierno, lo que los convierte en apreciadas plantas de jardín."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Árboles"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b7e7c5a-874b-44b5-9b22-cc90e01c1ca0",
                                                "sense_id": "f754ecbc-3895-3de1-8d1e-bd42344a0839",
                                                "text": "Verdor nuevo los espinos\ntienen ya por la colina,\ntoda de púrpura y nieve\nen el aire estremecida."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da004d53-fb06-364e-a989-c441c7ae9c15",
                                        "entry_id": "2050cbb8-494a-36b5-81ea-812ede2a5fa0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(Acacia caven) Árbol, de la familia de las Leguminosas (Fabaceae), espinoso, de flores amarillas y fruto característico en legumbre, que al madurar da una hermosa vaina dura y negra que contiene las semillas. Crece en tierras con poca agua y en los faldeos cordilleranos de América del Sur. Su madera es explotada para fabricar carbón vegetal. Es cultivado como arbusto de jardín."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Argentina",
                                            "Chile"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bfeb1448-a918-4e75-be97-23de5a468d67",
                                                "sense_id": "da004d53-fb06-364e-a989-c441c7ae9c15",
                                                "text": "El espino prende a una roca\nsu enloquecida contorsión,\ny es el espíritu del yermo,\nretorcido de angustia y sol."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "12fdbc95-086f-30a0-9a12-47a3112c7e1c",
                                        "entry_id": "2050cbb8-494a-36b5-81ea-812ede2a5fa0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nombre común que reciben en diferentes regiones diversas especies de plantas con tallos o ramas espinosos, entre ellos Genista anglica, Rhamnus lycioides y Berberis vulgaris."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Plantas"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
